  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 5.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf eahta man beon ofslagene, ðonne is ðæt friðbrec, binnan byrig oððon buto[n]. Binnan eahta mannum bete man þæt fullum were.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If eight men are slain, that constitutes a breach of the truce, whether in a town or in the open country. For less than eight men the full wergeld shall be paid as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si eahta men occidantur, pertineat infractio pacis intra curiam uel adiacentias eius. Eahta men persoluantur plena wera.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
